						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 311<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1100.msg10901#msg10901"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1100.msg10901#msg10901">Re: Mods...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> September 07, 2004, 01:12:20 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">If we ignore him, will he go away?</div>&nbsp; <br /><br />I doubt it.&nbsp; So let&#039;s pick on the grammar again.&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br /><br />I give this rant a grade of D.&nbsp; Please note the following corrections and suggestions for your rewrite, which will be due by 10am on Wednesday to receive credit.&nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Okay, we all (1.4% of us) love and admire (cough) the mods of these boards, but to be honest.</div><br />&quot;but&quot; is used as a conjunction and should be followed by at least a subject and a verb.&nbsp; The phrase &quot;to be honest&quot; doesn&#039;t qualify.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">THEY&#039;RE here basically to flame us when we use little/no grammer in our posts, mispell a word, mess up something in our sigs, etc etc. </div><br />It&#039;s &quot;grammar&quot; and &quot;misspell&quot;.&nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">All they really do is hit people when their down, especially, ive noticed. In this forum folder.</div><br />Use &quot;they are&quot; instead of &quot;their&quot;.&nbsp; &quot;In this forum folder&quot; is a sentence fragment.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">They abbuse their power and I demand a recount.</div><br />It&#039;s &quot;abuse&quot;.&nbsp; Also what vote are you demanding be recounted?&nbsp; You&#039;re not talking about an election.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">A real man laughs,<br />A real man cries.</div><br />Consider replacing this text, whichs follows that whiny crap about crying, with a Shakespeare quote.&nbsp; &quot;If you prick us do we not bleed?&quot;&nbsp; <br /><br />------<br /><br />Yes, I&#039;m bored today.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
